{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495935,"name":"Raymond Weiss","username":"Raymond_Weiss","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/raymond_weiss/{size}/106802_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T20:53:23.490Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495935-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495935-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495935-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495935-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSame problem as the past few previous days, all my bots again stopped talking, any help is appreciated.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495935-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495935-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003etalk to a bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495935-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495935-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ethey talk back\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495935-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495935-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWindows 10/11\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495935-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495935-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003enewest version\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495935-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495935-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"